        -:   39:/**
        -:   40: * This class handle bitmap images in KiCad.
        -:   41: *
        -:   42: * It is not intended to be used alone, but inside another class so all methods are protected
        -:   43: * or private.  It is used in #SCH_BITMAP class, #DS_DRAW_ITEM_BITMAP, and possibly others in
        -:   44: * the future.
        -:   45: *
        -:   46: * @warning Not all plotters are able to plot a bitmap.  Mainly GERBER plotters cannot.
        -:   47: */
        -:   48:class BITMAP_BASE
