        -:  125:     *
        -:  126:     * This box should be an enclosing perimeter for visible components of this object,
        -:  127:     * and the units should be in the pcb or schematic coordinate system.  It is OK to
        -:  128:     * overestimate the size by a few counts.
        -:  129:     */
        -:  130:    const BOX2I GetBoundingBox() const;
